            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Thimble 0.2.2 lists your projects in alphabetical order.

- Projects now read A to Z everywhere: the sidebar, All Projects, the Dashboard, the Move To list, and Android's drawer and Dashboard. Names sort the way Finder sorts them, so "Plan 2" comes before "Plan 10".
- Dragging a project onto another one still moves it into that project's area.
]]></description>
